; lib_terminal/hosts: a Tui program (../Tui.mli) in a window, where
; ../unix is the host that is a terminal: a screen of cells painted
; with Plan 9's default font, a cell a character, the window's size the
; number of rows and columns. ix's own (written for mini-turbopascal,
; docs/plans/plan_pascal.md, "The window"; here since mini-emacs has
; the same hosts, docs/plans/plan_emacs.md). What the hosts share:
; Cells (what changed between two screens, the colours, the PC's box
; characters, painted on a surface; a key and a click as a terminal's
; bytes) and Picture (a surface in memory, with the font's bits:
; Linux's hosts', and the frames of the tests). sdl/: a window on
; Linux; draw/: one of mini-rio's, under mini-9pi.
(library
 (name ix_terminal_hosts)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries ix_terminal ix_graphics ix_core))
